From: mscharged-port
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt original audio resource metadata to native ABI
Upstream-base: a8187061af65aa2022bfd8dc2e32163089ea0090

Retain the whole Matching source parsers, chunk traversal, AVL/cue lookup,
loops and rebasing decisions. Native allocation-owned POD views decode Wii32
metadata without changing raw headers, source owners or DSP samples. Saved
record origins use exact original wire strides rather than truncated pointers.
Full sample loading/factory/SP/AX/playback remain independent predecessors.

